          {
            "msg_id": "M9",
            "speaker_id": 31940,
            "reply_to": "M6",
            "text": "So, based on this, I'd propose our top three bottlenecks are: 1. The forklift path creating a safety risk and stoppage. 2. Inconsistent handling of hazardous materials causing delays and contamination. 3. General congestion from material pile-ups at the line start.",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [
              "D1"
            ],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M10",
            "speaker_id": 468833,
            "reply_to": "M9",
            "text": "That captures the most critical issues perfectly. I agree with that list.",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": [
              {
                "emoji": "white_check_mark",
